// WASI Preview 1 raw bindings.
//
// All functions use i32/i64 types matching the WASM ABI directly.
// Pointer parameters (iovecs, buffers, outparams) are i32 linear memory addresses.
// Functions return i32 errno values (0 = success).
//
// NOTE: Function wrappers are defined but cannot be called until T0283 is fixed
// (extern functions on WASM use sret convention instead of direct returns).
//
// Generated by: promise bind wit wasi_preview1.wit -name wasi -target wasi
// Polished: inlined doc annotations, added target(wasi) on public wrappers.

